  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "今天比昨天冷\n\n丽丽：爸，我们这儿下雪了。\n爸爸：冷不冷啊？\n丽丽：很冷。今天比昨天冷。昨天0度，今天零下5度。你那儿天气怎么样？\n爸爸：今天的天气比昨天好。昨天下雨，今天是晴天。\n丽丽：今天几度？\n爸爸：11度。\n丽丽：天气预报说你那儿明天会降温，你要多穿点衣服啊。\n爸爸：好的。",
    "traditional": "今天比昨天冷\n\n麗麗：爸，我們這兒下雪了。\n爸爸：冷不冷啊？\n麗麗：很冷。今天比昨天冷。昨天0度，今天零下5度。你那兒天氣怎麼樣？\n爸爸：今天的天氣比昨天好。昨天下雨，今天是晴天。\n麗麗：今天幾度？\n爸爸：11度。\n麗麗：天氣預報說你那兒明天會降溫，你要多穿點衣服啊。\n爸爸：好的。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Today Is Colder Than Yesterday"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：爸，我们这儿下雪了。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：爸，我們這兒下雪了。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì bà wǒ men zhè‘r xià xuě le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Dad, it's snowing over here."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "爸爸：冷不冷啊？",
      "traditional": "爸爸：冷不冷啊？",
      "pinyin": "bà ba lěng bù lěng a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dad: Is it cold?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：很冷。今天比昨天冷。昨天0度，今天零下5度。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：很冷。今天比昨天冷。昨天0度，今天零下5度。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hěn lěng jīn tiān bǐ zuó tiān lěng zuó tiān 1 dù jīn tiān líng xià 1 dù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "你那儿天气怎么样？",
      "traditional": "你那兒天氣怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ nà'r tiān qì zěn me yàng",
      "english": "Lili: Very cold. Today is colder than yesterday. Yesterday was 0 degrees, today it's minus 5 degrees."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "How is the weather over there?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "爸爸：今天的天气比昨天好。昨天下雨，今天是晴天。",
      "traditional": "爸爸：今天的天氣比昨天好。昨天下雨，今天是晴天。",
      "pinyin": "bà ba jīn tiān de tiān qì bǐ zuó tiān hǎo zuó tiān xià yǔ jīn tiān shì qíng tiān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dad: Today the weather is better than yesterday. Yesterday it was raining, today the sky is clear."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "丽丽：今天几度？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：今天幾度？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì jīn tiān jǐ dù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: How many degrees is it today?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "爸爸：11度。",
      "traditional": "爸爸：11度。",
      "pinyin": "bà ba 2 dù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dad: 11 degrees."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "丽丽：天气预报说你那儿明天会降温，你要多穿点衣服啊。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：天氣預報說你那兒明天會降溫，你要多穿點衣服啊。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì tiān qì yù bào shuō nǐ nà'r míng tiān huì jiàng wēn nǐ yào duō chuān diǎn yī fu a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: The weather forecast said it will be colder tomorrow over there. Make sure you put on enough clothes."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "爸爸：好的。",
      "traditional": "爸爸：好的。",
      "pinyin": "bà ba hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dad: Sure."
    }
